<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
  The car's own apps and what comes up over the car's screen: the Phone (dialer, recents,
  contacts), calls, messages and notifications, Cinema, Plancia (Home Assistant inside myCar),
  the voice assistant's buttons and toasts (not its words: those are in the assistant's own
  phrasebooks), the spoken turn-by-turn directions and the Bluetooth cards. Almost everything
  here shows on a car's display, read at a glance: keep buttons and tabs short.
-->
